     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"9\\frac{5}{{14}}\"></span></p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Multiply the integer part by the denominator.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"9 \\times 14 = 126\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Add the product to the numerator.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"126 + 5 = 131\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write the sum divided by the denominator.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\frac{{131}}{{14}}\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    },
    {
